    "directions": [
      "Boil until the raisins absorb most of the liquid. Add the cinnamon after boiling.",
      "Peel the cucumber, add to a bowl and combine with 1 tablespoon of crushed peanuts.",
      "Line nori sheet and place half a cup of basmatti/wild rice (previously cooked with extra water + 1 tablespoon of apple cider vinegar).",
      "Carefully spread evenly 1/4 tablespoon of mustard, then layer the cucumber-peanut mixture and finally add 1 tablespoon of the raisin marmalade.",
      "Roll the sheet. Serve on contrasting color plate. Garnish with mustard seeds."
    ],
